{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look Down is a survival horror game in which you have been kidnapped by a former government scientist and shrunk to serve as a guinea pig in his macabre experiments. Now trapped in a dangerous environment, your only goal is to escape\u2014but it won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a hostile world where everyday objects become gigantic obstacles and lethal traps. Use your wits to climb furniture, avoid turrets, and escape a robotic vacuum cleaner programmed to hunt you down without mercy. Using telekinesis mechanics, manipulate objects to open paths and protect yourself, while uncovering the secrets behind the kidnapper and his intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can run, hide, and fight, but remember: he\u2019s always watching. And if you fail, you\u2019ll be just another lost guinea pig.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420290?t=1744150969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420290?t=1744150969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420290/bf2c10be74d00ed9099b22919bd1208623ca3559/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744150969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420290/bf2c10be74d00ed9099b22919bd1208623ca3559/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744150969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look Down is a survival horror game in which you have been kidnapped by a former government scientist and shrunk to serve as a guinea pig in his macabre experiments. Now trapped in a dangerous environment, your only goal is to escape\u2014but it won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a hostile world where everyday objects become gigantic obstacles and lethal traps. Use your wits to climb furniture, avoid turrets, and escape a robotic vacuum cleaner programmed to hunt you down without mercy. Using telekinesis mechanics, manipulate objects to open paths and protect yourself, while uncovering the secrets behind the kidnapper and his intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can run, hide, and fight, but remember: he\u2019s always watching. And if you fail, you\u2019ll be just another lost guinea pig.</p>","developers":["Matheus Pfeifer"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420290/209ef131032036101dfd9991e87de1420cd13e60/header.jpg?t=1744150969","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120819,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120819/movie480.mp4?t=1744150968","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120819/movie_max.mp4?t=1744150968"},"name":"Look Down - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120819/753a7c7ee2c8c23c68fece03927ee049e2964b4f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744150968","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120819/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744150968","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120819/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744150968"}}],"name":"Look Down","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows: 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> gtx 1050 ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Recomendado</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas